.TH SANCHALA-DIAGNOSTICS 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-diagnostics \- macOS-style Activity Monitor and System Information
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-diagnostics
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sanchala Diagnostics provides comprehensive system monitoring and hardware
information tools for Sanchala OS, similar to macOS Activity Monitor and
System Information utilities.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS "System Overview"
.TP
.B overview
Display complete system overview (default command)
.TP
.B summary
Quick system health summary with status indicators
.TP
.B report
Generate detailed system report
.SS "Process Monitoring"
.TP
.B top
Launch interactive system monitor (btop/htop/top)
.TP
.B processes \fR[\fISORT\fR]
List processes sorted by cpu, mem, pid, or time
.TP
.B kill \fIPID\fR [\fISIGNAL\fR]
Terminate process with optional signal (default: 15)
.TP
.B priority \fIPID\fR \fINICE\fR
Set process priority (-20 to 19)
.SS "CPU & Memory"
.TP
.B cpu
CPU information, frequencies, and usage
.TP
.B memory
Memory usage details and top consumers
.TP
.B swap
Swap usage and configuration
.TP
.B load
System load averages
.SS "Disk & Storage"
.TP
.B disk
Disk usage overview
.TP
.B smart \fR[\fIDEVICE\fR]
SMART health status (requires smartmontools)
.TP
.B io
Disk I/O statistics
.TP
.B mounts
Mounted filesystems
.TP
.B partitions
Partition layout
.SS "Network"
.TP
.B network
Network interface status
.TP
.B connections
Active network connections
.TP
.B ports
Open ports and listeners
.TP
.B ping \fIHOST\fR
Connectivity test
.TP
.B traceroute \fIHOST\fR
Network path trace
.SS "Hardware"
.TP
.B hardware
Complete hardware information
.TP
.B pci
PCI devices
.TP
.B usb
USB devices
.TP
.B sensors
Temperature and fan sensors
.TP
.B battery
Battery status (laptops)
.SS "Diagnostics"
.TP
.B health
System health check with thresholds
.TP
.B benchmark
Quick system benchmark
.TP
.B logs \fR[\fISERVICE\fR]
System logs viewer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output in JSON format
.TP
.B \-\-export \fIFILE\fR
Export report to file
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version information
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Display system overview:
.B sanchala-diagnostics
.TP
Check disk SMART status:
.B sanchala-diagnostics smart /dev/sda
.TP
Test network connectivity:
.B sanchala-diagnostics ping google.com
.TP
Export system report:
.B sanchala-diagnostics report --export ~/report.txt
.TP
JSON output:
.B sanchala-diagnostics overview --json
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/diagnostics/diagnostics.toml
Main configuration file
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/diagnostics/btop.conf
btop theme configuration
.TP
.I /var/log/sanchala/diagnostics.log
Log file
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR btop (1),
.BR htop (1),
.BR smartctl (8),
.BR sensors (1),
.BR lspci (8),
.BR lsusb (8)
